@HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### healthcheck
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### get all projects
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

###

### get all costs by model
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/models/1/costs
Accept: application/json

###

### get costs by scope
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/models/1/costs/by-scope?scopeId=EXTERIOR
Accept: application/json

###

### get model attributes
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/models/1/attributes
Accept: application/json